---
import { Icon } from 'astro-iconset/components';
---

<section id="pricing" class="py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-accent-500)] sm:text-4xl">
        Pricing and Services.
      </h2>
      <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-700">
        Straight Forward, No Hassle Pricing
      </h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6">
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        There are several factors that determine pricing, which is why we offer free estimates.
        We get to see all the factors involved while give you an accurate estimate.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        Most customers are surprised how affordable stump grinding can be and
        its always a good idea to check references and get more than one estimate
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        Price includes standard cleanup, we do not "grind and leave"
      </p>
      
      {/* Full Service Clean Up */}
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-[var(--color-accent-200)] bg-[var(--color-neutral-50)] p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent-500)]">
          Full Service Clean Up
        </h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          We offer a Full Service Cleanup option in addition to the standard cleanup that
          comes with every stump grinding job.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
          Our Full Service Cleanup includes application of:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-base text-gray-700">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="material-symbols:check-circle" class="h-5 w-5 text-[var(--color-success-500)]" />
            Top soil
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="material-symbols:check-circle" class="h-5 w-5 text-[var(--color-success-500)]" />
            Seeds
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="material-symbols:check-circle" class="h-5 w-5 text-[var(--color-success-500)]" />
            Mulch
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
